Date: Fri, 31 May 2024 10:24:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 0888/1695] dts: st: add scmi-agent-id in scmi_regu node in
 stm32mp231.dtsi

After patch "core: scmi-server: regulator: use agent_id and channel_id
from parent", nodes with compatible "st,scmi-regulator-consumer" should at
least have a scmi-agent-id property and a scmi-channel-id.

Update stm32mp231.dtsi

